From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 19:30:00 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] drm/msm/adreno: add the missing break in
 __snapshot_sect_init()

clang warns about the unannotated fall-through from the
ADRENO_SNAPSHOT_SECTION_REGS_V2 case into the default case
(-Wimplicit-fallthrough, enabled for the kernel build). The default case
only breaks, so a break after the REGS_V2 case is the same code.

Fixes: a7e12c21a86e ("drm/msm: Import adreno_snapshot.h")
Signed-off-by: mzak <mzak.amin@gmail.com>
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_snapshot.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_snapshot.h b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_snapshot.h
index e8ff102a628b..6e301a9eb97e 100644
--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_snapshot.h
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/msm/adreno/adreno_snapshot.h
@@ -391,6 +391,7 @@ __snapshot_sect_init(struct adreno_gpu_state *state, uint16_t id, size_t extra_s
 	switch (id) {
 	case ADRENO_SNAPSHOT_SECTION_REGS_V2:
 		sect_hdr_sz = 0;
+		break;
 	default:
 		break;
 	}
